      "side": 1,
      "message": "It is more an API test. I got the name from here [1].\nAccording to this doc, in rust unit tests are the tests in the `src` directory together with the code, which can check the private functions. While integration tests _use your library in the same way any other code would, which means they can only call functions that are part of your library’s public API_.\n\n[1] https://doc.rust-lang.org/book/ch11-03-test-organization.html",
      "parentUuid": "f87b7a0f_1d977fe0",
